Read docs/plans/D/D-to-C-reply-AGENTS-governance.md (D's reply to C'sgovernance review). Revise AGENTS.md to fulfill its five commitments:
three-tier access table; add execution_policy.py as approved new module;
repo-root-relative paths + most-restrictive-wins; Prompt.md moved to
planning-start in reading order + task-specific ADR/contract reads;
baseline correction (baseline-v0 = b5d2f67, bebc576 = main HEAD);
stop rule requires independent approval of plan version + test version +
scope, with re-approval triggers; note opencode.jsonc is the enforced
config and permissions.jsonc the policy source.
Modify only AGENTS.md. Output your plan first and STOP for approval.
